This product contains code ported from:

* BOA - Body and Organ Analysis (Apache License 2.0)
  https://github.com/UMEssen/Body-and-Organ-Analysis
  Copyright IKIM / SHIP-AI, University Hospital Essen
  (body composition analysis post-processing, tissue derivation, measurements,
  Excel output, DICOM handling)

* TotalSegmentator (Apache License 2.0)
  https://github.com/wasserth/TotalSegmentator
  Copyright Jakob Wasserthal
  (task definitions, label maps, resampling/cropping/reorientation helpers,
  NIfTI label-map extension; ported from v2.12.0 as vendored by BOA)

* Open Thymus Segmentator (Apache License 2.0)
  https://github.com/vprudente/open_thymus_segmentator
  Copyright 2023 Vasco Prudente & Keno Bressem
  (pre-/post-processing parameters, windowing, model definition)

* MONAI (Apache License 2.0)
  https://github.com/Project-MONAI/MONAI
  Copyright MONAI Consortium
  (minimal re-implementations of UNet, Spacing/SpatialResample, NormalizeIntensity,
  GaussianSmooth, ScaleIntensity, sliding window inference and
  KeepLargestConnectedComponent in boa_light/thymus.py)

Model weights are downloaded at run time and are not part of this package. Only
the openly licensed (Apache-2.0) TotalSegmentator models and the BOA body
composition models are used. Please cite TotalSegmentator, BOA and nnU-Net when
using this software (see README.md).
